    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, do u know if it's okay to take st johns wort for my mood? im feeling kinda down lately since the weather changed but i also take an oral contraceptive pill every day. just wanted to make sure they dont clash or anything",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
