      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is extremely important that you do not take St. John's Wort while on oral contraceptives. This herb is a potent inducer of liver enzymes, which can cause your birth control pills to be metabolized and cleared from your system much faster, making them less effective. Skipping your pill could lead to unintended pregnancy, so please consult your prescribing doctor immediately to discuss safe mood management options.",
