    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? i heard it was just a natural herb so i didnt think it would be that big of a deal. i usually just take the pill at the same time every night so i'm pretty consistent with it. are you sure it actually stops it from working? i've read online that it's fine as long as you're careful.",
